  "notes": "Live Velvet Factory office frontend. Pulls modules/packs from VelvetOS Core. Velvet Visual Foundry uses one Creative Manifest plus Creative Director, Brand Guardian and Media Librarian specialists; exception-only and standing-authorized for LOW-risk routine organic Instagram only. Approved private-source derivatives route through the canonical Publish Bridge before Instagram publish. Owner-approved grid visual standard is mandatory for public visual QA/preflight; brand-asset, creative-transformation and project-request gates are fail-closed."
